{"meta":{"id":"ng-di-inject-function","title":"Injection context là gì? Vì sao gặp lỗi NG0203, và viết hàm injectX() tái sử dụng thế nào cho an toàn?","track":"angular","topic":"di","tags":["di","injection-context","inject","composition"],"type":"question","level":"mid","domain":[],"asked_at":[],"minutes":6,"status":"done","verified_on":"2026-11-09","ng_version":"22","private":false,"related":["ng-di-inject-ways","ng-core-destroyref","ng-core-composition-vs-inheritance"],"srs":true,"sources":[],"layer":"theory","askedAt":[],"verifiedOn":"2026-11-09","ngVersion":"22"},"intro":"","sections":[{"key":"question","label":"Câu hỏi","role":"prompt","answer":false,"empty":false,"html":"<p><code>inject()</code> chỉ gọi được trong injection context. Injection context là gì, gồm những chỗ nào? Vì sao gặp <code>NG0203: inject() must be called from an injection context</code>? Viết một hàm tiện ích <code>injectQueryParam('page')</code> dùng lại được cho nhiều component.</p>\n"},{"key":"quick","label":"Câu trả lời tốt nhất","role":"primary","answer":true,"empty":false,"html":"<p>Injection context là <strong>khoảng thời gian Angular đang tạo một thứ gì đó</strong> và biết injector hiện tại là ai: constructor và field initializer của class được DI tạo (component, directive, service, pipe), hàm <code>useFactory</code> của provider, các hàm Angular gọi như guard, resolver, interceptor, và bên trong <code>runInInjectionContext(injector, fn)</code>. Ra khỏi khoảng đó — trong <code>ngOnInit</code>, callback <code>subscribe</code>, <code>setTimeout</code>, method bấm nút — Angular không biết lấy injector nào, nên ném <strong>NG0203</strong>. Cách viết hàm tái sử dụng: hàm gọi <code>inject()</code> bên trong, đầu hàm gọi <code>assertInInjectionContext(injectQueryParam)</code> để báo lỗi rõ ràng, trả về <strong>signal</strong>, và tự dọn dẹp bằng <code>DestroyRef</code>. Component chỉ cần <code>readonly page = injectQueryParam('page')</code> ở field.</p>\n"},{"key":"deep","label":"Trả lời đầy đủ","role":"detail","answer":true,"empty":false,"html":"<h3>Injection context gồm</h3>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Chỗ</th>\n<th>Ví dụ</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Constructor, field initializer</td>\n<td><code>private readonly api = inject(Api)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Factory provider</td>\n<td><code>useFactory: () =&gt; new X(inject(Y))</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Hàm router</td>\n<td><code>CanActivateFn</code>, <code>ResolveFn</code>, <code>CanMatchFn</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Interceptor hàm</td>\n<td><code>HttpInterceptorFn</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>runInInjectionContext(inj, fn)</code></td>\n<td>chạy <code>fn</code> với injector tuỳ chọn</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Initializer</td>\n<td><code>provideAppInitializer(() =&gt; inject(Config).load())</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h3>NG0203 hay gặp ở đâu</h3>\n<div class=\"ih-code\" data-lang=\"ts\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Report</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> implements</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> OnInit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  ngOnInit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> api</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> inject</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ReportApi);              </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// NG0203</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.form.valueChanges.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pipe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">takeUntilDestroyed</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">subscribe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// NG0203 — takeUntilDestroyed cũng dùng inject</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span></code></pre></div><p>Sửa: đưa <code>inject</code> lên field; với <code>takeUntilDestroyed</code> thì truyền <code>DestroyRef</code> đã inject sẵn.</p>\n<h3>Hàm <code>injectX()</code> tái sử dụng</h3>\n<div class=\"ih-code\" data-lang=\"ts\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> injectQueryParam</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">fallback</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ''</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Signal</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  assertInInjectionContext</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(injectQueryParam); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// báo lỗi rõ nếu gọi sai chỗ</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> route</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> inject</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ActivatedRoute);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> toSignal</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(route.queryParamMap.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pipe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(name) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">??</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fallback)), { initialValue: fallback });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Dùng</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TxnList</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  protected</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> page</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> computed</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">injectQueryParam</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'page'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'1'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)())); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// SAI: gọi trong computed</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TxnList2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  private</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> pageParam</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> injectQueryParam</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'page'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'1'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);           </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ĐÚNG: ở field</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  protected</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> page</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> computed</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pageParam</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span></code></pre></div><h3><code>runInInjectionContext</code> khi bắt buộc</h3>\n<div class=\"ih-code\" data-lang=\"ts\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">private readonly injector </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> inject</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Injector);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">openLater</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  setTimeout</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> runInInjectionContext</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.injector, () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ref</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> inject</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Dialog).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">open</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Confirm); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// hiếm khi cần — thường inject Dialog ở field là đủ</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span></code></pre></div><h3>Từ v22</h3>\n<p><code>@Service()</code> bắt buộc dùng <code>inject()</code> — không còn constructor injection cho service mới. Kiến thức về injection context vì vậy là bắt buộc.</p>\n"},{"key":"real","label":"Thực tế trong dự án của tôi","role":"personal","answer":true,"empty":false,"html":"<blockquote>\n<p><strong>Ngữ cảnh</strong> dựng từ dự án thật trong CV của bạn — kiểm tra lại chi tiết trước khi dùng. <strong>Tình huống điển hình</strong> là tình huống hay gặp ở dự án Angular ngân hàng, bảo hiểm do app biên soạn để luyện cách kể; số liệu trong đó là ví dụ minh hoạ. Khi phỏng vấn, chỉ nhận là của mình phần bạn đã thật sự làm; phần còn lại kể là tình huống đã tìm hiểu hoặc tái hiện.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><strong>Ngữ cảnh:</strong> công ty bảo hiểm C (Angular 21) dùng <code>inject()</code> khắp nơi; gặp lỗi NG0203 khi gọi <code>inject()</code> trong callback <code>subscribe</code> và trong hàm tiện ích gọi muộn.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Đã làm:</strong> chuyển <code>inject()</code> lên field hoặc constructor; viết hàm <code>injectX()</code> dùng lại (ví dụ lấy ngôn ngữ hiện tại) chỉ gọi trong injection context; chỗ thật sự cần thì <code>runInInjectionContext</code>.</li>\n<li><strong>Kết quả:</strong> hết NG0203 và có quy ước rõ cho cả team.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Tình huống điển hình:</strong> Gọi <code>inject(Router)</code> bên trong callback <code>subscribe</code> gây lỗi NG0203 vì đã ra khỏi injection context. Đội đưa mọi <code>inject()</code> lên field hoặc constructor; với logic dùng lại, viết hàm <code>injectX()</code> gọi ở field rồi trả về object có method; chỗ thật sự cần chạy muộn thì dùng <code>runInInjectionContext</code> với injector đã giữ. Hết lỗi NG0203 và code dùng lại gọn hơn.</p>\n<p><strong>Lưu ý khi kể:</strong> Hàm <code>injectX()</code> bạn đã viết chỉ nêu khi đúng.</p>\n"},{"key":"followup","label":"Sẽ bị hỏi tiếp","role":"next","answer":true,"empty":false,"html":"<ul>\n<li><strong>Hàm <code>injectX</code> khác service ở đâu?</strong> Mỗi lần gọi tạo state <strong>riêng</strong> cho nơi gọi nhưng vẫn dùng DI và vòng đời của component đó; service là instance dùng chung theo injector.</li>\n<li><strong>Có gọi <code>inject()</code> trong <code>computed</code> được không?</strong> Không — <code>computed</code> chạy lại bất kỳ lúc nào, không phải injection context. Inject ở field rồi đọc trong <code>computed</code>.</li>\n<li><strong>Test hàm <code>injectX</code> thế nào?</strong> <code>TestBed.runInInjectionContext(() =&gt; injectQueryParam('page'))</code> với <code>ActivatedRoute</code> giả trong providers.</li>\n</ul>\n"},{"key":"traps","label":"Bẫy thường gặp","role":"caution","answer":true,"empty":false,"html":"<ul>\n<li><strong>Gọi <code>inject</code> trong <code>ngOnInit</code> hay trong callback</strong> — NG0203.</li>\n<li><strong>Gọi <code>takeUntilDestroyed()</code> không tham số ngoài constructor</strong> — cùng lỗi.</li>\n<li><strong>Lạm dụng <code>runInInjectionContext</code> thay vì inject ở field</strong> — làm phụ thuộc khó thấy.</li>\n</ul>\n"},{"key":"sources","label":"Nguồn","role":"reference","answer":false,"empty":false,"html":"<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://angular.dev/guide/di/dependency-injection-context\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Angular — Injection context</a></li>\n</ul>\n"}]}